{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "But reckoning time, whose million accidents creep in twixt vows, and change decrees of kings, tan sacred beauty blunt the sharpest intents, divert strong minds to the course of altering things. Alas, why fearing of time's tyranny? Might I not then say, \"Now I love you best,\" when I was certain or in certainty, crowning the present, doubting of the rest.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["But", " reck", "oning", " time", ",", " whose", " million", " accidents", " creep", " in", " tw", "ix", "t", " vows", ",", " and", " change", " decre", "es", " of", " kings", ",", " tan", " sacred", " beauty", " blunt", " the", " shar", "pest", " intents", ",", " divert", " strong", " minds", " to", " the", " course", " of", " altering", " things", ".", " Al", "as", ",", " why", " fearing", " of", " time", "'s", " tyranny", "?", " Might", " I", " not", " then", " say", ",", " \"", "Now", " I", " love", " you", " best", ",\"", " when", " I", " was", " certain", " or", " in", " certainty", ",", " crow", "ning", " the", " present", ",", " doub", "ting", " of", " the", " rest", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
